     1	#!/usr/bin/env python3
     2	"""Check explicit disjoint resolved KTSs WITHOUT claiming a full large set.
     3	Format: PACKING v k, KTS i, CLASS j, then integer triples, zero-based ids.
     4	Run: python3 work/check_partial_packing.py evidence/c19-partial17.txt --expected-systems 17
     5	This checker imports neither search code nor the full LKTS checker.
     6	"""
